     "opp": 0.15791316526610644,
     "act_spread": 0.06902173913043479,
     "peak_token": "mic",
     "peak_char": 30
    },
    {
     "text": "The nucleus of the oculomotor nerve lies beneath the cerebral aqueduct at the level of the superior colliculus.",
