     "opp": 0.07659313725490197,
     "act_spread": 0.08315217391304347,
     "peak_token": "acts",
     "peak_char": 24
    },
    {
     "text": "Injury to the precentral gyrus produces paralysis because it contains the motor centres for the opposite side of the body.",
